yss is a brutal souls-like extraction adventure game set in massive dystopian worlds. Fight alone or in co-op, dive into dangerous zones for loot, and escape before the world kills you. Explore beautiful ruined landscapes and uncover secrets worth dying for.","steam_appid":3516100,"support_info":{"email":"lunardbay@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}